        {
          "text": "I can't give you a schedule that meets your rules yet. The schedule builder returned the same results twice, and they don't fit what you asked for.\n\n- **Friday classes:** CSE 310-02 (MWF), CIT 225-01 (MWF) and MATH 221A-01 (MWF) all meet on Fridays. Every schedule it returned includes at least one of them.\n- **Morning classes:** MATH 113-02 starts at 10:15, and REL 275-01 starts at 10:15. Both are before 11:30.\n- **Exclusions ignored:** I told the builder to leave those sections out, and it put them back in.\n\nA few sections do fit your rules:\n- CSE 212-02 meets T/R from 12:45 to 13:45.\n- WDD 231-01 meets T/R from 11:30 to 12:30.\n- MATH 113-03 meets T/R from 11:30 to 12:45.\n- REL 275-02 meets T/R from 12:45 to 13:45.\n- CSE 212-03 is online.\n\nSeats for all of these are as of 2026-11-13 15:00 UTC.\n\nFor the Friday-free classes, I haven't found sections for CSE 310, CIT 225, a statistics course, or a web backend course. I also haven't found any for CSE 270 or a CS elective. The only CSE 310 option the builder returned that isn't on Friday is CSE 310-03. It meets M/T/W/R from 14:00 to 15:00, but only in the second half of the semester, starting 2027-02-24.\n\nDo you want me to look up sections for those remaining courses one at a time? I'd then put together a schedule by hand and check each section against your rules.\n\nConfirm with BYU-Idaho Academic Advising.",
